  "text": "Accalon is a hero of Arthur's court and the lover of Morgan. He came from Gaul and was one of King Arthur's last foes in battle. Morgan stole the scabbard of Excalibur. That took away Arthur's magic shield against wounds. Accalon hoped to kill the king. But Merlin gave Arthur strength. Accalon fell under Arthur's blow.",
